        "id": 44186,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-12T19:42:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Player's choice only applies when a single card is taking multiple simultanious actions.&nbsp; When multiple cards are reacting to the same event (such as \"start of the turn\"), it applies in card order.&nbsp; If a card that states at the start of the turn skip the turn was played before another card that mentions at the start of turn, the latter card is skipped over.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:17:45.886Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
