      {
        "id": 44190,
        "name": "ketigid",
        "username": "ketigid",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-13T12:14:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The official ruling is, order of cards played across entire table.<br>\nOne easy variant is, the same as one card doing multiple actions, allow players to choose the order of timing effects if they occur at the same time. Thus will of course make the game much easier for the heroes.<br>\nMy personal preference is, order of cards played in round order. That is, villain cards first from left to right, heroes cards left to right in seat order, then environment cards left to right.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:17:46.220Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
